OL,3,GNEWSAAI is great, but it can't deliver 
OL,4,Aa lamb, say students                   
OL,6,FStudents looking to forge careers in   
OL,7,Fagriculture believe there is still a   
OL,8,Fneed for hands-on skills as they       
OL,9,Fembrace artificial intelligence (AI).  
OL,11,FBishop Burton College, in East         
OL,12,FYorkshire, and Riseholme College, in   
OL,13,FLincolnshire, which specialise in      
OL,14,Fland-based subjects, said they had seen
OL,15,Fa rise in the number of pupils         
OL,16,Fenrolling on some of their courses.    
OL,18,FStudents have been learning how they   
OL,19,Fcan use AI in the industry while also  
OL,20,Funderstanding the value of traditional 
OL,21,Fmethods.                               
