OL,3,GNEWSAAI is great, but it can't deliver 
OL,4,Aa lamb, say students                   
OL,6,FKaty Cranston, who studies agriculture,
OL,7,Fland management and livestock          
OL,8,Fproduction at Bishop Burton, said: "I  
OL,9,Fcan see why people are worried about   
OL,10,FAI. I think it's a great tool, but AI  
OL,11,Fcan't deliver a lamb, can it?"         
